# Keys, ledgers, and signed state from a pass, and the self-test's copy of them, at any depth (a copied run tree
# such as run6x/state/ too). Never commit them.
state/
selftest/
# The private answer key (python3 tests/live/make_cases.py writes it), in any tree. Never send it to a bot.
cases.jsonl
__pycache__/
# A run's outputs at the top of tests/live/, until they are moved into run<N>/ for a test branch (RELAY.md "After
# COMPLETE"): so a pass in progress is never committed to working by mistake. Anchored, so run<N>/relay/ is not.
/relay/
/logs/
/constitution/
/RESULTS.md
/results.json
# Live runs 6, 6z, 7x on live-runs: key and ledger material, referee-only notes, and the case table, at any depth.
*.pem
*.ledger-key/
*.witness/
*.capability/
*.redeem-locks/
ledger/
keys/
PLAN.md
STEP_*.md
TABLE*.txt
